": "1830449300822153", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982610_1830449304155486_9105627070072408848_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=EPB9mlmjAI0Q7kNvwEd_pj9&_nc_oc=Adl9kY4ymIor1qu2hc2Uks40n25KmrZBimKSKo8EzkSHYVtpN7jxJsp6Up0rsZ6i168&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfvU_vpLp9-X_sxD-j01B0UGlhO6C5IdhYOTNgD27i8hlw&oe=699EDB4A"}, {"file_name": "screenshot-13.png", "id": "9449026898446045", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974691_9449026905112711_4579666727095828995_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=O8RSLivuVpkQ7kNvwGGHR24&_nc_oc=AdkLXxX6zmnttDQGRRzbXlVo-orG3eYtd8g9ZcorDc9jErdLEGDtoszkXqngloqvnx0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Aftsz36YvCEAqGp5ib8YkwgnEgU5xCwMFzNxNEXl22887w&oe=699EEB84"}, {"file_name": "screenshot-11.png", "id": "1969264830167481", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974803_1969264833500814_717700601129842921_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=rgdiwfgbN1cQ7kNvwGRkOeo&_nc_oc=AdmrmHHdEyMoxvOhfjvopKmIUS3HCdJhdILHdAPjlRiGkrYYC9PeXnUGJw98A9cASgU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Afsyb3OMIHpHLNO2ygxTIPzKpBH-a-eSeT1YLoM69Obmbg&oe=699EF15E"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Trailer-Cover-Image-MINI.png", "id": "1128857345307826", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/43997708_1128857348641159_7151441411599407678_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=gHoCuhDP610Q7kNvwHiemHv&_nc_oc=AdmCmj0TpgRUMtxAiwcXiIwyyYDi0J83t7VG_vZnVOaMLpL8lbw90FxNOuQn9tz7zeU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Afu-sW9W02u8ev5b0_Qakzhjjjy3c6YtEyP5VovMjdSL3g&oe=699EDC0C"}, "display_name": "Squingle Mini", "keywords": ["puzzle", "MR", "puzzling", "demo", "squingle"], "long_description": "# \ud83c\udf00 Buy Squingle Mini for only $0.99 and save $2 on the full game when you upgrade!\n\nSquingle Mini, offers an incredible bite-sized experience of the unique Mixed Reality 3D puzzle game, Squingle. \n\nEmbark on a journey where the lines between the virtual and real worlds blur, offering endless fun and mind-bending challenges.\n\nGuide the orbs from start to finish, avoid the edges, and collect points as you navigate through glass-like mazes called \u2018Squingles.\u2019\ud83c\udf20\n\n\n# \ud83c\udf08 A VISUAL MASTERPIECE\nEach maze is a stunning, morphing, glass-like sculpture that comes to life in either Mixed Reality or a fully immersive environment, offering an unmatched visual experience in the puzzle genre.\n\n\n# \ud83e\udde9 ACCESSIBILITY\nDesigned to be accessible for a wide range of players and skill levels, with intuitive controls and hand-tracking support for seamless play, whether standing or seated.\n\n\n# \ud83d\ude0c GLOBAL LEADERBOARD\nCompete on the Squingle Mini Leaderboard! See the sum of your best times across all levels and compare them with others around the globe.\n\n \n# \ud83d\udc7b RACE YOUR GHOST\nChallenge your best times on each level to improve your leaderboard rank for endless fun!\n\n\n# \ud83c\udf00 Immerse yourself in the world of Squingle, where every twist presents a new challenge! \ud83c\udf20", "short_description": "\ud83c\udf00 Buy Squingle Mini for only $0.99 and save $2 on the full game when you upgrade!\n\nSquingle Mini, offers an incredible bite-sized experience of the unique Mixed Reality 3D puzzle game, Squingle. \n\nEmbark on a journey where the lines between the virtual and real worlds blur, offering endless fun and mind-bending challenges.\n\nGuide the orbs from start to finish, avoid the edges, and collect points as you navigate through glass-like mazes called \u2018Squingles.\u2019\ud83c\udf20"}]}, "developer_name": "Dr. Benjamin Outram ", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://squingle.com/privacy-policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "VRAL Games", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://squingle.com